{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LORT is a 1\u20138 player co-op action roguelite. Team up with your friends to battle, loot, and stack ridiculous powerups across a cursed fantasy world. Fight toward escape, revive your homies, and get absolutely chadded as you evolve from goblin tickler to god slapper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/fd59d752f75fb9f0c5fb60ffafabcebd.avif?t=1772644874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras_big/fd59d752f75fb9f0c5fb60ffafabcebd.avif?t=1772644874 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/e9578f111284e60e800855350190b83a.poster.avif?t=1772644874\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/e9578f111284e60e800855350190b83a.webm?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/e9578f111284e60e800855350190b83a.mp4?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your homies (or bravely solo it) for chaotic, over the top co-op madness. Combo your attacks, cover each other's backs, and rally your friends by blowing the tooter as the chaos scales from &quot;this seems fine&quot; to &quot;oh no.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/5d34b6947abfe8b031896217846e0267.avif?t=1772644874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras_big/5d34b6947abfe8b031896217846e0267.avif?t=1772644874 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/e853f6a83124a9bbbe06cc52e59c2fcf.poster.avif?t=1772644874\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/e853f6a83124a9bbbe06cc52e59c2fcf.webm?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/e853f6a83124a9bbbe06cc52e59c2fcf.mp4?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords, wands, bows, or the age-old gun\u2014 it\u2019s all up to you. Freely swap your weapons, discover explosive combos, and pick your favorite way to slap goblins into next week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/41339840a605d9267ec9f8202b6d0fe5.avif?t=1772644874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras_big/41339840a605d9267ec9f8202b6d0fe5.avif?t=1772644874 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/5cf82c1b378573f42bd31d751ebad766.poster.avif?t=1772644874\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/5cf82c1b378573f42bd31d751ebad766.webm?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/5cf82c1b378573f42bd31d751ebad766.mp4?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerup in your hand is worth two in a chest. Get to mixing, matching, and stacking to outhit and outlast your enemies with powerups like:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nah\u2019s Barrier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boomer\u2019s Blessing </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trophy of Swole</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool Comfy Shorts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And over 100 more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/7f026a9b08269c4f555fcde0180b2f92.avif?t=1772644874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras_big/7f026a9b08269c4f555fcde0180b2f92.avif?t=1772644874 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/b7494b136b30fc5d1b705949eafb6e12.poster.avif?t=1772644874\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/b7494b136b30fc5d1b705949eafb6e12.webm?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/b7494b136b30fc5d1b705949eafb6e12.mp4?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive, weird, and ready to ruin your run - these bosses hit hard, play dirty, and laugh at your cute little powerups. Learn the dance, punish their weakness, and slap back harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/a8b84d2e477d488dec8e57dd3d52edea.avif?t=1772644874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras_big/a8b84d2e477d488dec8e57dd3d52edea.avif?t=1772644874 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/eda6f8bcea328e1be00f813ba7a31116.poster.avif?t=1772644874\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/eda6f8bcea328e1be00f813ba7a31116.webm?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/eda6f8bcea328e1be00f813ba7a31116.mp4?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just any run - it's THE run. Achieve peak powerup perfection, become absurdly overpowered, and turn the tables on this cursed world. Goblins will tell horror stories about you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/c068bd83f8c6f41538dc9be6f564805e.avif?t=1772644874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras_big/c068bd83f8c6f41538dc9be6f564805e.avif?t=1772644874 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/2105f31e7e92874948f27acac1bf2094.poster.avif?t=1772644874\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/2105f31e7e92874948f27acac1bf2094.webm?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/2105f31e7e92874948f27acac1bf2094.mp4?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your ingredients. Choose your quests. Build the run you want. Choices you make stir the pot, determining which bizarre enemies, cursed locations, and giant, weirdo bosses show up to ruin your day. Cook up chaos, or play it smart... just don\u2019t under season it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/e674465eac561c761af5b73177b6c9fd.avif?t=1772644874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras_big/e674465eac561c761af5b73177b6c9fd.avif?t=1772644874 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/596dffeff35602f6471bcb735d2a7ed5.poster.avif?t=1772644874\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/596dffeff35602f6471bcb735d2a7ed5.webm?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/596dffeff35602f6471bcb735d2a7ed5.mp4?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Thanks for sticking around. No loot here, just raw appreciation. You read the whole thing. That\u2019s rare. You might actually be... the chosen one.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Goblin Dundee\u2019d","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2956680/7e311c327074ed432d85e6233819a52786d623d7.jpg"},{"name":"Canopy Cache","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2956680/d2b4fc6598cfbc85b877a11a96fe3ad9823b43f8.jpg"},{"name":"Leaf Him Alone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2956680/1168c5b3483f32f26d8cd040ef3439116b3fee22.jpg"},{"name":"Mid Management","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2956680/537ef4ebd8a743393b22588b9ccbc1bf31eb7bdb.jpg"},{"name":"Freed from the Curse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2956680/0b5dbee8d9f627985f553ed496e98ac690d0a466.jpg"},{"name":"Its Not Over Yeti","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2956680/93cb9a3592cc394d47019a5960f157026c6b3b06.jpg"},{"name":"Purse Peasant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2956680/f65173389d5c20cf5e1bf984e0169f9a4373ce78.jpg"},{"name":"Wallet Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2956680/06974fc77071909fe755ab44cca5644491ec28d7.jpg"},{"name":"Camp Counselor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2956680/f89aa1850deb41b5dc85a50ce8f53115ad1339aa.jpg"},{"name":"First Course","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2956680/d15cde310ba1de008f1e9c93540cc5071f1b6ac3.jpg"}],"total":42},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2956680?t=1772644874","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2956680?t=1772644874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/bd108f05f059c7f52c7b570f2fd8f5d1f3dd6aa8/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1772644874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/bd108f05f059c7f52c7b570f2fd8f5d1f3dd6aa8/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1772644874","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/96d097c5aa88a4c76445f24917ea78a0.avif?t=1772644874\" width=1560 height=5640 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Join the Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/8a47e3390bdea12282c4cab30aebbfa5.avif?t=1772644874\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LORT is a 1\u20138 player co-op action roguelite. Team up with your friends to battle, loot, and stack ridiculous powerups across a cursed fantasy world. Fight toward escape, revive your homies, and get absolutely chadded as you evolve from goblin tickler to god slapper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/fd59d752f75fb9f0c5fb60ffafabcebd.avif?t=1772644874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras_big/fd59d752f75fb9f0c5fb60ffafabcebd.avif?t=1772644874 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/e9578f111284e60e800855350190b83a.poster.avif?t=1772644874\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/e9578f111284e60e800855350190b83a.webm?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/e9578f111284e60e800855350190b83a.mp4?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your homies (or bravely solo it) for chaotic, over the top co-op madness. Combo your attacks, cover each other's backs, and rally your friends by blowing the tooter as the chaos scales from &quot;this seems fine&quot; to &quot;oh no.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/5d34b6947abfe8b031896217846e0267.avif?t=1772644874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras_big/5d34b6947abfe8b031896217846e0267.avif?t=1772644874 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/e853f6a83124a9bbbe06cc52e59c2fcf.poster.avif?t=1772644874\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/e853f6a83124a9bbbe06cc52e59c2fcf.webm?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/e853f6a83124a9bbbe06cc52e59c2fcf.mp4?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords, wands, bows, or the age-old gun\u2014 it\u2019s all up to you. Freely swap your weapons, discover explosive combos, and pick your favorite way to slap goblins into next week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/41339840a605d9267ec9f8202b6d0fe5.avif?t=1772644874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras_big/41339840a605d9267ec9f8202b6d0fe5.avif?t=1772644874 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/5cf82c1b378573f42bd31d751ebad766.poster.avif?t=1772644874\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/5cf82c1b378573f42bd31d751ebad766.webm?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/5cf82c1b378573f42bd31d751ebad766.mp4?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerup in your hand is worth two in a chest. Get to mixing, matching, and stacking to outhit and outlast your enemies with powerups like:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nah\u2019s Barrier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boomer\u2019s Blessing </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trophy of Swole</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool Comfy Shorts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And over 100 more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/7f026a9b08269c4f555fcde0180b2f92.avif?t=1772644874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras_big/7f026a9b08269c4f555fcde0180b2f92.avif?t=1772644874 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/b7494b136b30fc5d1b705949eafb6e12.poster.avif?t=1772644874\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/b7494b136b30fc5d1b705949eafb6e12.webm?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/b7494b136b30fc5d1b705949eafb6e12.mp4?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive, weird, and ready to ruin your run - these bosses hit hard, play dirty, and laugh at your cute little powerups. Learn the dance, punish their weakness, and slap back harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/a8b84d2e477d488dec8e57dd3d52edea.avif?t=1772644874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras_big/a8b84d2e477d488dec8e57dd3d52edea.avif?t=1772644874 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/eda6f8bcea328e1be00f813ba7a31116.poster.avif?t=1772644874\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/eda6f8bcea328e1be00f813ba7a31116.webm?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/eda6f8bcea328e1be00f813ba7a31116.mp4?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just any run - it's THE run. Achieve peak powerup perfection, become absurdly overpowered, and turn the tables on this cursed world. Goblins will tell horror stories about you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/c068bd83f8c6f41538dc9be6f564805e.avif?t=1772644874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras_big/c068bd83f8c6f41538dc9be6f564805e.avif?t=1772644874 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/2105f31e7e92874948f27acac1bf2094.poster.avif?t=1772644874\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/2105f31e7e92874948f27acac1bf2094.webm?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/2105f31e7e92874948f27acac1bf2094.mp4?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your ingredients. Choose your quests. Build the run you want. Choices you make stir the pot, determining which bizarre enemies, cursed locations, and giant, weirdo bosses show up to ruin your day. Cook up chaos, or play it smart... just don\u2019t under season it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/e674465eac561c761af5b73177b6c9fd.avif?t=1772644874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras_big/e674465eac561c761af5b73177b6c9fd.avif?t=1772644874 width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/596dffeff35602f6471bcb735d2a7ed5.poster.avif?t=1772644874\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/596dffeff35602f6471bcb735d2a7ed5.webm?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/extras/596dffeff35602f6471bcb735d2a7ed5.mp4?t=1772644874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Thanks for sticking around. No loot here, just raw appreciation. You read the whole thing. That\u2019s rare. You might actually be... the chosen one.</p>","developers":["Big Distraction"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2956680/67717768402de70a0ef07d3ce94394cda88d474c/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1772644874","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Big Distraction Co. All Rights Reserved. Big Distraction\u2122 and LORT\u2122 are trademarks of Big Distraction Co.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic